<div class="static-page">
  <section class="static-page__intro">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="static-page__subtitle">
      What Tempasi stores in your browser, and why.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>Short version</h2>
    <p>
      Tempasi uses exactly one cookie, and it's strictly necessary for the
      site to work: it keeps you logged in. There are no analytics
      cookies, no advertising cookies, and no third-party trackers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>The cookie we use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Name:</strong> <code>sid</code></li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> keeps your session logged in across page loads</li>
      <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 30 days, or until you log out</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Type:</strong> first-party, strictly necessary. Set with
        <code>HttpOnly</code> (not readable by page scripts) and
        <code>SameSite=Lax</code>, and <code>Secure</code> when the site
        is served over HTTPS.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Because this cookie is strictly necessary for a core feature (being
      logged in), it doesn't require a consent banner under GDPR — it's
      set automatically when you log in.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>What we don't use</h2>
    <p>
      No Google Analytics, no advertising pixels, no third-party
      trackers, no cookies for anything other than your session. If that
      changes in the future, this page — and a consent banner where
      required — will change with it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, but doing
      so for Tempasi will log you out and you won't be able to stay
      signed in.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Reach out at
      <a href="mailto:support@tempasi.com">support@tempasi.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
